Cell["Limits", "Section",
 CellID->1020575516,ExpressionUUID->"4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],

Cell["\<\
The exterior theorem concerns p>V+t and assumes D and W. The escape theorem \
needs D but does not force a nonzero value at the moving center depth U+t. \
The broader arbitrary-three-bit-background conjecture remains unproved. \
Neither result proves invisible canonical fields impossible, backward \
closure, or center nonperiodicity. No solution of Problems 1, 2 or 3 is \
claimed.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1967685850,ExpressionUUID->"741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],

